00:44:29.275 --> 00:44:30.543
THIS IS TRULY AN AMAZING MILESTONE THAT WE'RE

00:44:30.543 --> 00:44:35.943
CELEBRATING HERE TODAY. LA CASA DE LAS MADRES BEGAN

00:44:36.482 --> 00:44:37.751
IN 1974 WHEN A GROUP OF PASSIONATE WOMEN WERE

00:44:37.751 --> 00:44:41.754
DETERMINED TO CREATE A PLACE OF SAFETY FOR SURVIVORS OF

00:44:41.754 --> 00:44:44.754
DOMESTIC VIOLENCE. >> THESE WOMEN TIRELESSLY

00:44:45.958 --> 00:44:49.558
RESEARCHED HOW INSTITUTIONS HANDLE DOMESTIC VIOLENCE

00:44:49.829 --> 00:44:53.566
INTERVIEWED LIVE FORESMAN OFFICIALS AND COLLECTED ALL THE

00:44:53.566 --> 00:44:59.566
INFORMATION THEY COULD ON THE THEN CURRENT DATA AND SUPPORT

00:45:00.247 --> 00:45:03.847
AVAILABLE TO SURVIVORS OF DOMESTIC VIOLENCE.

00:45:04.251 --> 00:45:08.923
>> THEY FOUND THAT THERE WAS AN INSUFFICIENT AND WHOLLY

00:45:08.923 --> 00:45:13.461
INADEQUATE AMOUNT OF RESOURCES FOR SURVIVORS AND THEIR KIDS.

00:45:13.461 --> 00:45:16.864
THIS ENCOURAGED THESE PASSIONATE WOMEN TO DEVELOP

00:45:16.864 --> 00:45:20.868
FUNDING PROPOSALS TO TESTIFY AT LOCAL HEARINGS ON MARITAL

00:45:20.868 --> 00:45:24.738
VIOLENCE TO RAISE AWARENESS ON THE ISSUE.

00:45:24.738 --> 00:45:28.676
>> IN 1976 LA CASA DE LAS MATTRESS WAS OFFICIALLY FOUNDED

00:45:28.676 --> 00:45:32.746
AS AN ESTABLISHED ORGANIZATION. THEY THEY BEGAN PROVIDING FOR

00:45:32.746 --> 00:45:37.546
CORE SERVICES WHICH INCLUDED A 24 SEVEN CRISIS HOTLINE

00:45:40.870 --> 00:45:44.920
EMERGENCY SHELTER FOR WOMEN AND CHILDREN COMMUNITY SUPPORT

00:45:44.920 --> 00:45:45.226
GROUPS AND PREVENTION EDUCATION EFFORTS.

00:45:45.226 --> 00:45:50.297
>> OVER THE LAST 50 YEARS LA CASA DE LAS MADRES HAS SERVED

00:45:50.297 --> 00:45:52.697
OVER 14,000 DOMESTIC VIOLENCE SURVIVORS.

00:45:53.300 --> 00:45:57.972
>> THEY HAVE GROWN TREMENDOUSLY IN NOT ONLY THEIR REACH ACROSS

00:45:57.972 --> 00:46:01.709
THE COMMUNITY AND CAPACITY TO SERVE BUT THE CRITICAL SERVICES

00:46:01.709 --> 00:46:05.513
THEY PROVIDE PEOPLE. >> LIKE I SAID, THE LAS MADRES

00:46:05.513 --> 00:46:09.316
HAS ALSO PLAYED AN ACTIVE ROLE IN REFORMING THE LEGAL SYSTEM

00:46:09.316 --> 00:46:13.387
ACROSS SAN FRANCISCO AND REALLY ACROSS THE COUNTRY TO ENSURE

00:46:13.387 --> 00:46:18.787
