00:46:24.640 --> 00:46:27.664
SURVIVORS FACING FINANCIAL INSECURITY, IMMIGRATION STATUS

00:46:27.735 --> 00:46:31.720
AND OTHER BARRIERS TO SUCCESS. >> LIKE I SAID, THE LAST MADRES

00:46:31.720 --> 00:46:35.609
IS NOT ONLY AN ESSENTIAL SUPPORT AND RESOURCE FOR

00:46:35.609 --> 00:46:39.347
COMMUNITY IN PROVIDING SHELTER AND HELP TO SURVIVORS, THEY

00:46:39.347 --> 00:46:43.150
ALSO ARE ACTIVELY BUILDING A FUTURE WHERE DOMESTIC VIOLENCE

00:46:43.150 --> 00:46:47.421
IS ABOLISHED, WHERE SOME SURVIVORS ARE BELIEVED, WHERE

00:46:47.421 --> 00:46:50.824
THEY ARE SUPPORTED AND HEALTHY RELATIONSHIPS ARE THE NORM.

00:46:50.824 --> 00:46:55.429
WE ARE SO GRATEFUL TO LA CASA DE LAS MADRASAHS IMPACT AND SAN

00:46:55.429 --> 00:46:58.232
FRANCISCO THEIR INFLUENCE ACROSS THE COUNTRY

00:46:58.232 --> 00:47:02.360
AND CONTINUED DEDICATION TO ADVOCATING FOR SURVIVORS OF

00:47:02.360 --> 00:47:06.240
DOMESTIC VIOLENCE. TODAY WE ARE JOINED BY FOUNDERS

00:47:06.240 --> 00:47:09.240
STAFF VOLUNTEERS, SUPPORTERS AND SURVIVORS.

