ACTUALLY TODAY APRIL SEVENTH MARKS 50 YEARS OF LA CASA DE

00:48:01.245 --> 00:48:03.781
LAS MATTRESS. 50 YEARS AGO A GROUP OF WOMEN

00:48:03.781 --> 00:48:09.454
