00:48:21.198 --> 00:48:22.734
HAVE COME TO LA CASA AND SOME OF THE MOST DIFFICULT MOMENTS

00:48:22.734 --> 00:48:25.937
OF THEIR LIVES SEEKING SAFETY, SUPPORT AND A CHANCE TO BEGIN

