IT REFLECTS THE CITY'S LONG STANDING COMMITMENT TO

00:48:41.686 --> 00:48:45.423
SURVIVORS AND THE PARTNERSHIP THAT MAKE THIS WORK POSSIBLE

00:48:45.423 --> 00:48:49.360
EVERY DAY. EARLIER TODAY WE GATHERED ON

00:48:49.360 --> 00:48:52.630
THE STEPS OF CITY HALL TO MARK THIS MILESTONE NOT JUST TO

00:48:52.630 --> 00:48:54.980
