SUPERVISOR WALTON THANK YOU, MADAM CLERK.

00:52:06.895 --> 00:52:10.633
COLLEAGUES TODAY I AM INTRODUCING A RESOLUTION

00:52:10.633 --> 00:52:14.833
AFFIRMING SAN FRANCISCO'S COMMITMENT TO THE SAFETY,

00:52:14.903 --> 00:52:18.708
DIGNITY AND BELONGING OF PACIFIC ISLANDER COMMUNITIES

00:52:18.708 --> 00:52:22.712
AND CONDEMNING THE HATE VIOLENCE AND TARGETED THREATS

00:52:22.712 --> 00:52:23.979
THEY HAVE FACED. PACIFIC ISLANDERS HAVE ALWAYS

00:52:23.979 --> 00:52:27.516
BEEN A PART OF THIS CITY. THEIR HISTORY HERE IS ROOTED

00:52:27.516 --> 00:52:30.516
IN RESILIENCE, CULTURAL CONTRIBUTION, LABOR

00:52:31.453 --> 00:52:35.124
AND COMMUNITY BUILDING AND YET THEIR COMMUNITY HAS BEEN

00:52:35.124 --> 00:52:38.861
SUBJECTED TO A PATTERN OF TARGETED THREATS AND FALSE

00:52:38.861 --> 00:52:42.732
NARRATIVES DESIGNED TO DIMINISH THEIR PRESENCE AND UNDERMINE

00:52:42.732 --> 00:52:47.136
THE LEGITIMACY OF THEIR INSTITUTE ACTIONS HERE IN SAN

00:52:47.136 --> 00:52:49.536
FRANCISCO. THIS IS UNACCEPTABLE.

00:52:50.473 --> 00:52:51.874
NO COMMUNITY SHOULD HAVE TO FIGHT FOR THEIR RIGHT TO EXIST

00:52:51.874 --> 00:52:56.674
AND THEIR OWN CITY. THIS AFTERNOON THE PACIFIC

00:52:58.281 --> 00:53:02.485
ISLANDER COMMUNITY AS WELL AS SEVERAL MEMBERS FROM COMMUNITY

00:53:02.485 --> 00:53:06.688
MARCHED TO THE STEPS OF CITY HALL AND HOSTED A RALLY AT

00:53:06.688 --> 00:53:10.559
CIVIC CENTER PLAZA TO SAY LOUD AND CLEAR THAT THEY WILL NOT BE

00:53:10.559 --> 00:53:14.159
ERASED. THIS RESOLUTION IS THE BOARD'S

00:53:14.296 --> 00:53:18.340
ANSWER TO THAT CALL AND WE STAND WITH SAN FRANCISCO'S

00:53:18.340 --> 00:53:22.704
PACIFIC ISLANDER COMMUNITY. I WANT TO THANK MY CO-SPONSORS

00:53:22.704 --> 00:53:26.304
SUPERVISORS CHIN CHEN DORSEY AND WONG.

00:53:29.245 --> 00:53:33.490
>> I'M ALSO INTRODUCING A RESOLUTION ALONG WITH MY

00:53:33.490 --> 00:53:37.601
CO-SPONSOR SUPERVISOR MELGAR AS WELL AS SUPERVISORS CHIN CHEN

00:53:37.601 --> 00:53:41.801
DORSEY AND WONG. A RESOLUTION DECLARING APRIL

00:53:44.800 --> 00:53:48.546
11TH THROUGH APRIL 17TH AS BLACK MATERNAL HEALTH WEEK HERE

00:53:48.546 --> 00:53:51.683
IN SAN FRANCISCO. THIS YEAR MARKS THE 10TH

00:53:51.683 --> 00:53:54.752
ANNIVERSARY OF THE BLACK MAMAS MATTER ALLIANCE.

00:53:54.752 --> 00:53:55.820
AND THIS WEEK MATTERS MORE THAN EVER.

00:53:55.820 --> 00:54:01.759
THE DATA WE ARE PRESENTED WITH IS NOT IMPROVING FAST ENOUGH.

00:54:01.759 --> 00:54:05.229
BLACK BIRTHING MOTHERS MAKING UP JUST 4% OF BIRTHS IN SAN

00:54:05.229 --> 00:54:08.166
FRANCISCO BUT ACCOUNT FOR 50% OF PREGNANCY RELATED DEATHS.

00:54:08.166 --> 00:54:12.966
RATES OF VERY PREMATURE BIRTHS AMONG BLACK BABIES.

00:54:14.505 --> 00:54:19.305
THOSE BORN AT 32 WEEKS EARLIER INCREASED BY 71% BETWEEN 2016

00:54:23.581 --> 00:54:27.181
AND 2024, RISING FROM 2.1% TO 3.6% OF BIRTHS.

00:54:27.385 --> 00:54:31.550
THAT IS THEY CONTINUE CRISIS WHILE OUTCOMES FOR BLACK

00:54:31.550 --> 00:54:35.126
BIRTHING PARENTS AND THEIR BABIES HAVE BEEN DECLINING.

00:54:35.126 --> 00:54:38.996
AND THAT'S THE INVESTIGATION FOUND THAT SAN FRANCISCO HAS

00:54:38.996 --> 00:54:43.401
UNDERSPENT ITS BUDGET TO ADDRESS MATERNAL INEQUITIES BY

00:54:43.401 --> 00:54:48.201
AT LEAST $8 MILLION SINCE 2021, RETURNING THE HIGHEST PORTION

00:54:49.140 --> 00:54:50.474
OF ITS PRENATAL EQUITY INITIATIVE FUNDS BACK TO THE

00:54:50.474 --> 00:54:53.611
STATE. WE CANNOT TALK ABOUT COMMITMENT

00:54:53.611 --> 00:54:57.211
WHILE LEAVING MONEY ON THE TABLE.

00:54:57.281 --> 00:55:00.284
THAT WAS SUPPOSED TO BE DEDICATED TO REDUCING BLACK

00:55:00.284 --> 00:55:02.684
PREGNANCY RELATED DEATHS NATIONALLY.

00:55:03.955 --> 00:55:07.959
WHILE MATERNAL MORTALITY RATES HAVE DECLINED FOR WHITE,

00:55:07.959 --> 00:55:12.162
HISPANIC AND ASIAN WOMEN, BLACK WOMEN'S RATES HAVE HELD STEADY

00:55:12.162 --> 00:55:16.501
OR WORSENED WITH BLACK WOMEN DYING AT MORE THAN THREE TIMES

00:55:16.501 --> 00:55:20.704
THE RATE OF WHITE WOMEN. THE CENTER FOR DISEASE CONTROL

00:55:20.704 --> 00:55:24.441
CONFIRMED THAT THE MATERNAL MORTALITY RATE DECREASE FOR

00:55:24.441 --> 00:55:27.644
EVERY RACIAL GROUP EXCEPT BLACK WOMEN IN SAN FRANCISCO.

00:55:27.644 --> 00:55:33.440
WE ARE IN FACT ONE OF THE WORST EXAMPLES.

00:55:34.318 --> 00:55:35.853
THESE DISPARITIES ARE ROOTED IN SYSTEMIC RACISM.

00:55:35.853 --> 00:55:39.453
THEY ARE ALSO ROOTED IN DISINVESTMENT.

00:55:39.923 --> 00:55:43.600
FEDERAL RESTRUCTURING UNDER THE CURRENT ADMINISTRATION HAS

00:55:43.600 --> 00:55:46.660
HALTED COMMUNITY BASED MATERNAL HEALTH GRANTS.

00:55:46.864 --> 00:55:48.265
ELIMINATING THE WHITE HOUSE BLUEPRINT FOR ADDRESSING THE

00:55:48.265 --> 00:55:52.136
MATERNAL HEALTH CRISIS AND LAID OFF MOST STAFF IN THE CDC'S

00:55:52.136 --> 00:55:54.536
DIVISION OF REPRODUCTIVE HEALTH.

00:55:55.740 --> 00:55:59.276
